veloper Guide","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":2,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":3,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"## Acknowledgements","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":4,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":5,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"{list here sources of all reused/adapted ideas, code, documentation, and third-party libraries -- include links to the original source as well}","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":6,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":7,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"## Design \u0026 implementation","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":8,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":9,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"The v1.0 MVP uses a small command-line interface so that each user action is","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":10,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"handled as one input followed by one output. The application does not use","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":11,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"continuous input, timers, animations, or other real-time behaviour.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":12,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":13,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"### Component responsibilities","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":14,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":15,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* `Duke` is the application entry point. It owns the main command loop and","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":16,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"  coordinates the parser, user interface, and active game.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":17,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* `Parser` converts a line of user input into a command and its arguments. For","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":18,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"  example, `play 1` is parsed as the command `play` with the argument `1`.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":19,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* `Ui` handles console input and output, including the startup banner, prompts,","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":20,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"  game feedback, and error messages.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":21,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* `Game` is the common abstraction for a playable game. It defines the","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":22,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"  operations needed to start a game, process a command, and leave the game.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":23,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"  The v1.0 will provide one Wordle-style game through this abstraction.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":24,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":25,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"### v1.0 interaction model","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":26,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":27,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"The application processes one complete command at a time:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":28,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":29,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"1. The user enters a command.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":30,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"2. `Parser` identifies the command and its arguments.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":31,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"3. The active component performs the requested action.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":32,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"4. `Ui` displays the result and waits for the next command.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":33,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":34,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"The planned v1.0 flow is:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":35,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":36,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"```text","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":37,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"\u003e play 1","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":38,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"Starting Wordle. Enter a five-letter guess.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":39,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":40,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"\u003e guess apple","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":41,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"Feedback: ...","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":42,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":43,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"\u003e exitgame","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":44,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"Returning to the main menu.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":45,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":46,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":47,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"The command `play \u003cgameId\u003e` starts a game, where game `1` is the Wordle-style","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":48,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"game. Inside the game, `guess \u003cword\u003e` submits one guess and produces feedback.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":49,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"The command `exitgame` leaves the active game, while `exit` closes the","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":50,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"application. Invalid commands display an error message without crashing the","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":51,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"application or consuming a guess.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":52,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":53,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":54,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"## Product scope","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":55,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"### Target user profile","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":56,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":57,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"Playstation -1 is for busy individuals who work or study in a command-line","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":58,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"environment and want a short, clearly bounded break. It also targets retro","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":59,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"gaming enthusiasts and minimalists who prefer lightweight text-based games","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":60,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"over resource-intensive graphical games.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":61,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":62,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"### Value proposition","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":63,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-25T00:58:18","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":64,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"Playstation -1 provides low-commitment CLI games that can be played in short","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":65,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"sessions with clear completion. Users can choose a game, interact with it using","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":66,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"simple commands, and receive immediate feedback without needing graphics,","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":67,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"animations, or a long uninterrupted session.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":68,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":69,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"### v1.0 scope","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":70,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":71,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"The v1.0 MVP is a CLI launcher with one playable Wordle-style game. A game session","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":72,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"uses a fixed number of guesses, with a maximum of six valid five-letter","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":73,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"guesses. The session ends when the user guesses the word or uses all available","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":74,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"guesses.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":75,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":76,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"The MVP includes:","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":77,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":78,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* the existing CLI startup flow and help command;","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":79,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* launching the game with `play \u003cgameId\u003e`;","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":80,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* submitting guesses with `guess \u003cword\u003e`;","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":81,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* feedback after every valid guess;","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":82,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* error messages for invalid input; and","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":83,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"* returning to the launcher with `exitgame`.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":84,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":85,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"The MVP deliberately excludes continuous input, timers, animations, and","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":86,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"background processing.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":87,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":88,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"### Future features outside the MVP","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":89,"author":{"gitId":"LimZiJing"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-06T20:10:22","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":90,"author":{